<section id="content" class="bg-white py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto space-y-12">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Be There Exactly When Your Community Needs You
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          When serious accidents happen, people often search online first—before they call one of the lawyers. They want answers: What happened? Who's hurt? Why? What are their rights? This moment—right when information is needed—is when your law firm can step forward as a trusted, local authority.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Why Real-Time Accident Articles Work
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          In personal injury law, timing matters just as much as expertise.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          By publishing real-time accident news, your firm doesn't wait for clients to find you—you meet them where they are, when the stakes are highest. A few stats:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>76% of personal injury clients research online before contacting a law firm</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>62% pick the first firm that feels both local and trustworthy</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Nearly 1 in 3 hire a lawyer within 72 hours after an accident</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mt-6">
          Timely, relevant content bridges the gap between a traumatic event and legal help—when people need both information <em>and</em> support.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[20px] leading-[28px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          How This Builds Your Community Influence & Online Presence
        </h4>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Using local accident news in your content strategy does more than attract traffic. It builds trust, positions you as an authority, and strengthens your SEO in your local market.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Boost local visibility.</strong> Geo-specific terms like "Car accident on [Highway] in [City]" match how people search after incidents near them.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Drive traffic that matters.</strong> Readers of accident-related posts are often victims, family, or witnesses—people who may need your services now or soon.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Establish trust.</strong> Being seen regularly in local news gives your firm credibility and shows you're part of the community—not just a business.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[20px] leading-[28px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          What Makes a "High-Value" Case?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Not all accident stories have the same legal potential. We focus on events that meet certain criteria so you don't waste time chasing leads that lead nowhere:
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] list-decimal pl-6">
          <li>Clear liability</li>
          <li>Significant damages</li>
          <li>Adequate insurance or resources for compensation</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          How We Help & What You Get
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          As your local news affiliate, you get:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Exclusive rights</strong> in your county: no competing firm from the same area</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Custom accident-news content</strong> aligned with your practice areas and local interests</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>End-to-end support</strong>: we handle sourcing, writing, publishing, and distributing the content</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Local stories</strong>: serious accidents, local crimes, community happenings—whatever resonates with your area</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          The Results You Can Expect
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          With this strategy, you'll start seeing:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Better local SEO and higher rankings in your region</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>More website visitors who are already looking for help</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Stronger community credibility and trust</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Increased leads through clear, well-placed calls to action</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-8 rounded-[4px]">
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Ready to Lead in Your Community?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Don't let another firm capture the clients who need you most. When the next major accident happens in your area, will people find <em>you</em>?
        </p>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Reach out today to discuss:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          <li>First access to breaking local accident reports</li>
          <li>How to dominate local search results</li>
          <li>Turning content into consultations</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[rgb(34,66,125)] text-white rounded-[4px] px-6 py-3 text-[18px] font-normal hover:bg-[rgb(26,51,97)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center">
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
